ith tools=yes flags. This is mentioned in the class reference docs\r\n\r\nSupersedes #64065\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #64065\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15643\r\n- Somewhat resolves https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15625 With this PR will be possible to implement this proposal as an addon\r\n- In addition to UI/UX capabilities, this class allows to vlidate scripts from CICD by implementing MainLoop and listening to arbitrary user commands\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nI created a testing project using the GdScript test case. This project includes the gdscripts with errors and also an addon that adds a context menu option to GdScripts to print errors and warnings to console\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3daa781b-6a8d-4381-b252-d309c49a364b\" />\r\n\r\n[gd-script-validator-test-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33398559/gd-script-validator-test-project.zip)\r\n\r\n## AI usage disclosure\r\n\r\n~~AI was used to fill the [GDScriptValidator.xml](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...MarianoGnu:godot:raz/error-checker-40?expand=1#diff-27c0ff9626ce7fad4ac6e8cc8c6a9e67e78b00d91b7d74da6cfea41cfc1c5269) file~~\r\nEdit: Since this is agains contribution rules, all AI generated descriptions was removed from the PR and only human written class description remains.\r\nEdit2: Documentation is now filled with descriptions written by me.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g